Keep a shared known as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared won as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared answer as 0.
Keep a shared maxchoice as 0.
Set maxchoice to 10.
For every spot from 0 to 1023.
Place 0 into known.
Place 0 into won.

To search from mask (a whole number) with remaining (a whole number).
The good is 0.
If item mask of known is 1, set answer to item mask of won, return.
Set item mask of known to 1.
For every value from 1 to maxchoice.
The offset is value minus 1.
The bit is shift 1 left by offset.
The taken is bitwise and of mask and bit.
If good is 0 and taken is 0 and value is at least remaining, set good to 1.
If good is 0 and taken is 0 and value is less than remaining, search from mask plus bit with remaining minus value.
If good is 0 and answer is 0 and taken is 0 and value is less than remaining, set good to 1.
Set item mask of won to good.
Set answer to good.

Search from 0 with 11.
If answer is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
